                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Olney to Mr.
                            Runyon</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-10-29"><hi rendition="#italic">October 29,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Stern will not return to undergo imprisonment.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Olney</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
